{"name":"CloseButtonWebGL.md","path":"typedoc/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button/classes/CloseButtonWebGL.md","format":"markdown","html":"<article class=\"docs-md\"><p><a href=\"../../../../../../README.md\"><strong>luiskr.com</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"../../../../../../README.md\">luiskr.com</a> / <a href=\"../README.md\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button</a> / CloseButtonWebGL</p>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L29\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:29</a></p>\n<p>WebGL Animated Close Button\nFeatures:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Liquid fills slower and procedural rising bubbles with specular highlights</li>\n<li>Rotating X during hover/liquid animation</li>\n<li>Razor-sharp vector anti-aliased X line strokes (zero blur)</li>\n<li>Kinetic shockwave ripple on click</li>\n<li>Resilient Canvas 2D fallback</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"constructors\">Constructors</h2>\n<h3 id=\"constructor\">Constructor</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">new CloseButtonWebGL(canvas, onClickAction?): CloseButtonWebGL;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L74\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:74</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"parameters\">Parameters</h4>\n<h5 id=\"canvas\">canvas</h5>\n<p><code>HTMLCanvasElement</code></p>\n<p>overlay canvas inside the host\n  <button>; pointer events are bound to the parent button, not the canvas</p>\n<h5 id=\"onclickaction\">onClickAction?</h5>\n<p>(() =&gt; <code>void</code>) | <code>null</code></p>\n<p>forwarded after each click (the\n  shockwave always fires; the host&#39;s close handler runs alongside)</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>CloseButtonWebGL</code></p>\n<h2 id=\"properties\">Properties</h2>\n<h3 id=\"canvas\">canvas</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">canvas: HTMLCanvasElement;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L30\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:30</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"onclickaction\">onClickAction</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">onClickAction: (() =&gt; void) | null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L31\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:31</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"width\">width</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">width: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L32\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:32</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"height\">height</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">height: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L33\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:33</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"ishovered\">isHovered</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">isHovered: boolean;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L34\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:34</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"hoverlevel\">hoverLevel</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">hoverLevel: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L35\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:35</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"drawprogress\">drawProgress</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">drawProgress: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L36\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:36</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"rotation\">rotation</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">rotation: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L37\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:37</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"clicktime\">clickTime</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">clickTime: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L38\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:38</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"usewebgl\">useWebGL</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">useWebGL: boolean;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L39\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:39</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"animid\">animId</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">animId: number | null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L40\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:40</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"starttime\">startTime</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">startTime: number;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L41\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:41</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"gl\">gl</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">gl: WebGLRenderingContext | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L42\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:42</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"program\">program</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">program: WebGLProgram | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L43\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:43</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"quadbuffer\">quadBuffer</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">quadBuffer: WebGLBuffer | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L44\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:44</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"uresolution\">uResolution</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uResolution: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L45\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:45</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"utime\">uTime</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uTime: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L46\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:46</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"uliquid\">uLiquid</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uLiquid: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L47\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:47</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"udraw\">uDraw</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uDraw: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L48\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:48</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"urot\">uRot</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uRot: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L49\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:49</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"uclicktime\">uClickTime</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">uClickTime: WebGLUniformLocation | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L50\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:50</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"apos\">aPos</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">aPos: number = 0;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L51\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:51</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"_ro\">_ro</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">_ro: ResizeObserver | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L52\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:52</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"_oncontextlost\">_onContextLost</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">_onContextLost: EventListener | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L53\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:53</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"_purged\">_purged</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">_purged: boolean = false;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L54\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:54</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"boundtarget\">boundTarget</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">boundTarget: Element | null = null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L55\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:55</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"methods\">Methods</h2>\n<h3 id=\"onmouseenter\">onMouseEnter()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">onMouseEnter(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L56\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:56</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"onmouseleave\">onMouseLeave()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">onMouseLeave(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L59\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:59</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"onclick\">onClick()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">onClick(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L62\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:62</a></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"init\">init()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">init(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L111\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:111</a></p>\n<p>Boot sequence: GL init → event binding → render start; fully degrades to the fallback path.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"initwebgl\">initWebGL()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">initWebGL(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L117\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:117</a></p>\n<p>Creates the WebGL context, compiles the shader program and sets up uniforms/buffers; falls back on any failure.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"bindevents\">bindEvents()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">bindEvents(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L126\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:126</a></p>\n<p>Wires hover + click on the parent button (not the canvas) — the canvas\nis a decorative overlay so interaction belongs to the semantic button.\nboundTarget is remembered for destroy().</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"sethover\">setHover()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">setHover(hovered): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L140\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:140</a></p>\n<p>Updates hover state — the shader renders the hover accent when true.</p>\n<h4 id=\"parameters\">Parameters</h4>\n<h5 id=\"hovered\">hovered</h5>\n<p><code>boolean</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"triggerclick\">triggerClick()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">triggerClick(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L149\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:149</a></p>\n<p>Records the click timestamp — the shader reads u_click_time to expand\nthe shockwave ring over its 0.4s window. The onClickAction callback is\ninvoked separately by the click handler, not here.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"setreducedmotion\">setReducedMotion()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">setReducedMotion(isReduced): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L157\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:157</a></p>\n<p>Applies prefers-reduced-motion: swaps the animation loop for one\nstatic frame render, or restarts the loop when motion is re-allowed.</p>\n<h4 id=\"parameters\">Parameters</h4>\n<h5 id=\"isreduced\">isReduced</h5>\n<p><code>boolean</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"_renderstatic\">_renderStatic()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">_renderStatic(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L169\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:169</a></p>\n<p>Draws one settled frame with the X fully drawn — used under reduced\nmotion or when the loop is stopped.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"animate\">animate()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">animate(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L175\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:175</a></p>\n<p>Starts the requestAnimationFrame render loop (skipped under reduced motion).</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"_renderwebgl\">_renderWebGL()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">_renderWebGL(now): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L181\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:181</a></p>\n<p>Per-frame WebGL render: updates time/hover uniforms and draws the quad.</p>\n<h4 id=\"parameters\">Parameters</h4>\n<h5 id=\"now\">now</h5>\n<p><code>number</code></p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"purge\">purge()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">purge(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L190\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:190</a></p>\n<p>webglPool hook — offscreen: stops the loop and force-loses the GL\ncontext so offscreen widgets hold no context slots; restore()\nrebuilds the program on re-entry.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"restore\">restore()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">restore(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L209\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:209</a></p>\n<p>Recreates the GL context + program and resumes the loop after a purge.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"destroy\">destroy()</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">destroy(): void;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts#L233\">core/utils/canvas/widgets/close-button.ts:233</a></p>\n<p>Releases the context, buffers, listeners and rAF handle so the canvas can be GC&#39;d.</p>\n<h4 id=\"returns\">Returns</h4>\n<p><code>void</code></p>\n</article>","mtime":"2026-10-09T03:03:43.901Z"}